6vR7_er0c\"/><figcaption>7. 越來越重視生活的儀式感（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「人物誌」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T07:40:48.415740+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2128,"images":36,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}